No, that way...

00:24:50.759 --> 00:24:53.400
that corner needs to align

00:25:40.720 --> 00:25:46.440
It's one of my first jobs building the battery box 

00:25:46.759 --> 00:25:50.880
but soon enough... it was I wasn't built very well. I had to learn a lot

00:25:51.400 --> 00:25:56.839
I wasn't able to insulate it which is important for batteries, the kind of batteries that I have now.

00:25:56.839 --> 00:26:04.400
They need to be warm enough in winter, so taking it down because it has no purpose anymore

00:26:06.319 --> 00:26:08.960
Yeah I've been cleaning up a lot this week.

00:26:08.960 --> 00:26:11.680
Family was here.

00:26:11.680 --> 00:26:14.640
They were here the whole week

00:26:14.640 --> 00:26:19.799
It's always the same, we're always working hard here. And we're just spending most of our time here.

00:26:19.799 --> 00:26:25.599
Not visiting much. Usually when you go on holiday you visit a lot of places, but we're...

00:26:27.519 --> 00:26:32.079
It kind of means we have enough here. It's such a beautiful place to spend time together

00:26:32.079 --> 00:26:37.240
You know, we have a lot of space here. At the outdoor kitchen, sometimes we're eating there, or here

00:26:38.079 --> 00:26:41.440
We were sleeping in the workshop for the first time.

00:26:41.440 --> 00:26:44.319
My dad is sleeping in the cabin and the rest is camping.

00:26:44.319 --> 00:26:47.359
My brother has his own van.

00:26:48.119 --> 00:26:54.599
Yeah, it's just really nice to spend time here in summer together. outside most of the time, working,

00:26:54.599 --> 00:26:57.240
My dad always cuts the grass

00:26:57.440 --> 00:27:01.119
So it looks already neat, because it was growing very high.

00:27:01.200 --> 00:27:04.880
Spent a lot of time chipping wood, actually, because there were big piles of...

00:27:05.519 --> 00:27:10.319
cut down birches over the years, so that was a lot of work.

00:27:10.319 --> 00:27:15.039
We've got a big pile of mulch up there now 

00:27:16.440 --> 00:27:19.160
Yeah, this was really great.

00:27:20.119 --> 00:27:23.160
We did a hike to the mountain, it was quite epic.

00:27:23.160 --> 00:27:26.599
My dad couldn't come, because he can't hike up that steep.

00:27:26.599 --> 00:27:28.599
It's quite a steep hike

00:27:28.599 --> 00:27:33.240
up to 2100m (6890ft)

00:27:33.240 --> 00:27:37.799
but yeah, it's always beautiful up there.

00:27:40.279 --> 00:27:42.839
Didn't do that much work on the solar panels.

00:27:42.839 --> 00:27:47.880
We prepared everything, the footings are finished, everything is stained, things are ready to go.

00:27:47.880 --> 00:27:54.279
I had to do a lot of work here to dig in cables, organize things and wire it better.

00:27:54.680 --> 00:27:56.440
So that's done.

00:27:56.440 --> 00:28:05.200
Then next week I'll continue here and also at the workshop. I have to do a bit more on electricity

00:28:05.720 --> 00:28:08.279
Another switch has arrived.

00:28:08.279 --> 00:28:10.839
Yeah, small things.

00:28:10.839 --> 00:28:12.200
But yeah, it's getting there.

00:28:12.200 --> 00:28:13.640
Chicks are doing well.

00:28:13.640 --> 00:28:19.000
They're becoming really beautiful birds. Like the black and white one is getting very spotted.

00:28:20.279 --> 00:28:28.279
and the brown one as well but I think it will become more contrasting because it's the same breed

00:28:29.359 --> 00:28:35.119
But a more brown version, so yeah, they're they're really pretty birds.

